{"id":"b5d372da36d50e0e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-martins-axiom-equivalent.md","title":"Martin's Axiom Equivalent","display":"thm-martins-axiom-equivalent — Martin's Axiom Equivalent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-martins-axiom-equivalent","aliases":["58-thm-martins-axiom-equivalent"],"display":"thm-martins-axiom-equivalent — Martin's Axiom Equivalent","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-martins-axiom-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-martins-axiom-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-martins-axiom-equivalent — Martin's Axiom Equivalent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4f557645bc9a749\" href=\"?note=b4f557645bc9a749\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md\">../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathbb P,R,\\mathcal D,D,G\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathbb P,R,\\mathcal D,D,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{CCC}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{CCC}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S,\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S,\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> uses the at-most-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> convention from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4f557645bc9a749\" href=\"?note=b4f557645bc9a749\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md\">../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbb P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,R))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,R))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\\exists G\\in V\\;\n(\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}(G,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset))\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbb P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,R))\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,R))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\\exists G\\in V\\;\n(\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}(G,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset))\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream atom defines <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\\)</span> directly using families of cardinality at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; no successor-cardinal shift is present.</li>\n<li>In particular, standard <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}_{\\aleph_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}_{\\aleph_1}\\)</span> implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_0}&gt;\\aleph_1\">\\(2^{\\aleph_0}&gt;\\aleph_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The equivalence now reproduces the sourced definition exactly: dense families are subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\)</span> and the available filter predicate is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}\">\\(\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}\\)</span>, not the nonexistent suffixed variant.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4f557645bc9a749","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4f557645bc9a749","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MA}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ uses the at-most-$\\kappa$ convention from [[../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\mathbb P,R,\\mathcal D,D,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{CCC}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S,\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MA}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbb P,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,R)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,R))\\\\\n&\\to\\forall\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,R))\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\to\\exists G\\in V\\;\n(\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}(G,\\mathbb P,R)\n\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;(G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset))\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MA}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MA}_{\\aleph_1}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{\\aleph_0}>\\aleph_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FilterOnPoset}","display":false}],"bytes":1775,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4300","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-martins-axiom-equivalent.md|58-thm-martins-axiom-equivalent]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["b4f557645bc9a749"]}